# This is a practice repository. The CSVs in data/ are synthetic (see
# data/README.md) and are committed on purpose. Real participant data must
# never be added here -- these patterns stop the obvious kinds from slipping
# in alongside them. Note that .gitignore does NOT apply to files already
# tracked, so it is a backstop, not the rule; the rule is that real data
# lives in the lab's own storage.
data/real/
*.wav
*.TextGrid
*.lab
